---
// Say you put in 50 of your own money and borrow 50: assets 100, debt 50, equity ratio 50%. The stock falls by the 7%
// daily limit each session. Equity ratio = (assets - 50) / assets; a broker that asks for 35% calls on the fourth session.
// Values: 100 -> 93 -> 86.49 -> 80.44 -> 74.81; ratios 50.0, 46.2, 42.2, 37.8, 33.2 (Python in the quiz verifiedBy).
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const W = 900, H = 380;
const debt = 50, lim = 0.07, call = 0.35;
const steps = Array.from({ length: 5 }, (_, k) => { const a = 100 * Math.pow(1 - lim, k); return { k, a, e: a - debt, r: (a - debt) / a }; });
const sy = (v: number) => 300 - v * 2.0;
---
<figure class="p07g">
  <div class="p07g-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Five stacked columns, one per session, for a position bought with 50 of own money and 50 of borrowed money. The asset value falls 7 percent a session: 100, 93, 86.5, 80.4, 74.8. The debt stays at 50, so the equity part shrinks: 50, 43, 36.5, 30.4, 24.8. The equity share falls from 50 percent to 46.2, 42.2, 37.8 and 33.2 percent, below the 35 percent line on the fourth session.">
    <text x="20" y="26" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Borrowed money does not shrink when the price does</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tiền vay không co lại khi giá giảm</tspan></text>
    <text x="20" y="46" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>Say 50 own money + 50 borrowed; the stock falls the 7% limit every session</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Giả sử 50 vốn tự có + 50 đi vay; cổ phiếu giảm sàn 7% mỗi phiên</tspan></text>
    {steps.map((s, i) => (
      <g>
        <rect x={80 + i * 130} y={sy(debt)} width="80" height={debt * 2.0} rx="3" class="grey" />
        <rect x={80 + i * 130} y={sy(s.a)} width="80" height={Math.max(s.e, 0) * 2.0} rx="3" class={s.r < call ? 'redf' : 'gold'} />
        <text x={120 + i * 130} y={sy(s.a) - 8} text-anchor="middle" class="num">{s.a.toFixed(1)}</text>
        <text x={120 + i * 130} y="326" text-anchor="middle" class="lab"><tspan data-lang-en>session {s.k}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>phiên {s.k}</tspan></text>
        <text x={120 + i * 130} y="346" text-anchor="middle" class={s.r < call ? 'num red' : 'num'}>{(s.r * 100).toFixed(1)}%</text>
      </g>
    ))}
    <rect x="740" y="76" width="150" height="104" rx="8" class="box" />
    <rect x="752" y="90" width="14" height="10" rx="2" class="grey" />
    <text x="772" y="100" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>debt: 50</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>nợ: 50</tspan></text>
    <rect x="752" y="110" width="14" height="10" rx="2" class="gold" />
    <text x="772" y="120" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>your equity</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>vốn của bạn</tspan></text>
    <rect x="752" y="130" width="14" height="10" rx="2" class="redf" />
    <text x="772" y="140" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>below 35%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>dưới 35%</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="bank" x="764" y="162" size="18" />
    <text x="780" y="166" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>margin call</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>gọi ký quỹ</tspan></text>
    <text x="20" y="372" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>Percent under each column: your equity divided by the asset value.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Số % dưới mỗi cột: vốn của bạn chia cho giá trị tài sản.</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>A 25.2% fall in the asset, spread over four limit-down sessions, took the equity share from 50% to 33.2%. The equity itself lost almost half.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Tài sản giảm 25,2% qua bốn phiên giảm sàn, đưa tỷ lệ vốn tự có từ 50% xuống 33,2%. Vốn tự có mất gần một nửa.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>

  .p07g { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .p07g-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .p07g svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 600px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .p07g text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .p07g .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p07g .sub { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p07g .m { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p07g .lab { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .p07g .bt { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p07g .num { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p07g .num.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .p07g .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .p07g .boxred { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .p07g .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .p07g .arrow { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .p07g .gold { fill: var(--gold); }
  .p07g .grey { fill: var(--text-muted); opacity: 0.55; }
  .p07g .redf { fill: var(--red); }
  .p07g .line-gold { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2.5; fill: none; }
  .p07g .line-red { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2.5; fill: none; }
  .p07g .dash { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; fill: none; }
  .p07g .dashred { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; fill: none; }
  .p07g figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
